合作上了，结果来了个骗样达人，要么好不容易拍了视频，数据差的没招了……\n现在有了这个小青苔工具，根据大家踩","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7628552107003612479","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7628552107003612479","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0144","question_id":"CQ-Q0144","citation_id":"smp-78daac93413a43089017cfb8ecce581e:11","title":"How to Find an Influencer for Your Brand: A Practical Guide | AdMinting","raw_url":"https://www.adminting.com/blogs/how-find-influencer-your-brand","normalized_url":"https://www.adminting.com/blogs/how-find-influencer-your-brand","host":"www.adminting.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0144","question_id":"CQ-Q0144","citation_id":"smp-78daac93413a43089017cfb8ecce581e:12","title":"巨量星图短直联动产品介绍-星图营销服务平台","raw_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/142728","normalized_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/142728","host":"www.xingtu.cn","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0144","question_id":"CQ-Q0144","citation_id":"smp-78daac93413a43089017cfb8ecce581e:13","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0144","question_id":"CQ-Q0144","citation_id":"smp-78daac93413a43089017cfb8ecce581e:14","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0144","question_id":"CQ-Q0144","citation_id":"smp-78daac93413a43089017cfb8ecce581e:15","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","c